    "description": "Welcome to the Sunnyside Residence - an expansive 3678 square feet of refined living space. Nestled in the highly sought-after Sunnyside neighborhood, this stunning 3-story home offers the perfect blend of luxury, smart design, and panoramic city views. With its generous size and elegant features, this is truly a place to stretch out, settle in, and call home.    The top floor offers three spacious bedrooms and two bathrooms all on one level, highlighted by soaring ceilings and abundant natural light. The primary suite showcases panoramic city views, a generous walk-in closet, and a spa-inspired ensuite bathroom. An open family room with a sleek wet bar provides an ideal setting for both relaxation and entertaining.    The main level welcomes you with a gracious foyer and a guest powder room, leading into a chef's kitchen featuring custom European cabinetry, an oversized island, and premium Thermador appliances. The kitchen flows effortlessly into an elegant dining area. Sliding glass doors from the living room open to a beautifully crafted Ipe wood deck perfect for indoor-outdoor living with sweeping, unobstructed city views.    The lower level includes a versatile media room with a second wet bar and an additional guest bedroom. Step out to a low-maintenance yard."
  },
